    "heightBasis": "No qualified architectural height in retained facts or native parent. Working anchor-ground-relative field-5m is an explicit visualization excavation estimate; shell hem5..7m, bulge18m/upper fold31m/roof42..43m, inner roof39m/deep aperture truss6.5m, gallery5/13/21m and three tiers field-relative1.4..12/15..22/25..37m are picture-led allocations, not a survey. Rounded aperture10m corners/four vent strips/staggered facet grid/support/row/portal and light diamond tone inventories are approximations. Shared opaque beadblasted stainless/expanded mesh/glazing/canvas do not certify exact panel alloys/perforation/reflectance/transmission. Architect photographs are undated and include site works; current condition/later changes are not inferred.",
